$ bin/fm-teardown.sh mate3
REFUSED: unsafe secondmate home removal target /tmp/fm-live-fix/home/.treehouse/root-98a933/1/root is not a seeded secondmate home
rc=1

### the home-lock check would have refused this same state on its own
$ fm_home_worktree_lock_check <home> mate3 <parent>
